@startuml seq_6_pmr_creator_safe_typed_anonymous
title 6. PMR Creator: CreateSafeTypedAnonymous (Daemon + Handle)
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "PMR User\n(Creator)" as User
participant "MemoryRegionFactory\n(singleton)" as MRF
participant "QnxTypedAnonymousMemoryRegion" as Region
participant "typedmemd\n(safe pool daemon)" as Daemon
participant "OS Kernel\n(QNX)" as OS
participant "SharedMemoryFactory\n(singleton)" as SMF
participant "SharedMemoryResource" as SMR
participant "ControlBlock\n(in SHM)" as CB
participant "MemoryResourceRegistry\n(singleton)" as REG

== Step 1: Create Anonymous Region via Typed Memory Daemon ==

User -> MRF : CreateSafeTypedAnonymous(id, size)
activate MRF

MRF -> MRF : dedup check
alt cache miss

note right #LightBlue : Typed memory team implements\nthis. Uses handle, not path.

MRF -> Region ** : construct (via typed memory\n  team's implementation)
activate Region

Region -> Daemon : open("/dev/typedshm/cmd", O_RDONLY)
activate Daemon
Daemon --> Region : cmd_fd

Region -> Daemon : devctl(cmd_fd,\n  DCM_TSHM_ALLOCATE_HANDLE,\n  {size})
note right : Daemon returns shm_handle_t\ninstead of a named path.

note right of Daemon #LightBlue
  Inside daemon:
  1. shm_open(SHM_ANON, O_RDWR|O_CREAT|O_ANON)
  2. shm_ctl(fd, SHMCTL_ANON|SHMCTL_SEAL
       |SHMCTL_TYMEM|SHMCTL_PHYS,
       typed_mem_fd_, size)
  3. shm_create_handle(fd, client_pid,
       O_RDWR, &handle)
  4. close(fd)
end note
Daemon --> Region : shm_handle_t
deactivate Daemon

Region -> OS : shm_open_handle(handle, O_RDWR)
note right : QNX-specific. Converts handle\nto local fd.
OS --> Region : fd

Region -> OS : mmap(NULL, size,\n  PROT_RW, MAP_SHARED, fd, 0)
OS --> Region : base_address

deactivate Region

note right : No LockFile, ACL, ftruncate.\nDaemon handles all of that.

MRF -> MRF : store weak_ptr for dedup

else cache hit (weak_ptr alive)
  note right : Return existing shared_ptr.
end

MRF --> User : Result<shared_ptr<MappedRegion>>
deactivate MRF

== Step 2: Wrap in Resource (SharedMemoryFactory) ==

User -> SMF : Create(region)
activate SMF

SMF -> REG : Is region already managed?

alt already managed
    REG --> SMF : Yes
    SMF --> User : Error(RegionAlreadyManaged)
else not yet managed
    REG --> SMF : No

    SMF -> SMR ** : construct(region, next_id)
    activate SMR
    SMR -> CB ** : placement-new at base
    activate CB
    note right : Usable region = [base + ControlBlock::TotalSize(), end).
    SMR --> SMF : ready
    deactivate SMR

    SMF -> REG : RegisterResource(id, resource)
    REG --> SMF : registered

    SMF --> User : Result<shared_ptr<SharedMemoryResource>>
end
deactivate SMF

== Step 3: Allocate in Safe Physical RAM (Anonymous) ==

User -> SMR : Allocate(512, align=8)
activate SMR
SMR -> CB : lock(mutex)
CB --> SMR : LockResult
SMR -> CB : bump already_allocated_bytes
SMR -> CB : unlock(mutex)
SMR --> User : ptr
deactivate SMR
note right #LightGreen : Handle shareable via IPC.\nSee Seq 7 for EOWNERDEAD handling.

@enduml
